Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz a Mathematician from germany that is combined the properites of calculus alongside Isaac Newton, they are considered to be on the same footing with that regard. 
Gottfried Leibniz was a Lutheran from the Holy Roman Empire. 
The son of a Moral philosophy teacher, as a boy he inherited his father's personal library. 
Leibniz remained committed to Trinitarian Christianity throughout his life. 
